touched arms, each narrowing (gate stays, exactly one member\n117|  admitted), each KILLED on two consecutive passes (4/4, 4/4), R0 control\n118|  SURVIVED: R1 adopted gate admits v0.6.0 lock (killer: configured-gate\n119|  v0.6.0 arm; proof: v0.5.0 mismatch arm); R2 admission admits 13.10\n120|  (killer: `.../13.10` arm shows `VerifyAssignedSections(13.10) = <nil>`;\n121|  proof: `.../13.1` arm — first pass caught a harness regex bug where\n122|  `/13.1` also matched `/13.10`; anchored to `/13\\.1$`); R3 historical root\n123|  admits exactly `v0.4.30` (scratch killer; proof: committed drift table).\n124|- Substitution note: the suggested \"legacy loop skipping v0.5.0\" arm is not\n125|  behaviorally testable through `VerifyRepository` — the loop sits behind\n126|  the whole-file freshness check and the exact `VerifyV070` delta-row pins,\n127|  so no FS input reaches it diverged and any source plant trips freshness\n128|  first. R1 (adopted-CLI gate, also producer-untouched) covers the\n129|  stale-lock class instead. The loop's presence and both legacy tests are\n130|  green.\n131|\n132|## 6. Docs, hygiene, suite\n133|\n134|- README/LOGBOOK make no launch-plan/stdin/caller_launch_plan/\n135|  environment_drift/curator-run runtime claim (explicit disclaimers quoted\n136|  in session); `pin.go`/`specdoc.go` P3 comments now true in the present\n137|  tense (`specpin.Current` still serves the v0.5.0 baseline — verified in\n138|  code; gates use `CurrentV070`/`LoadV070`).\n139|- Producer findings correctly out of scope: ci.yml job name untouched by the\n140|  candidate; `task-board validate` 191 pre-existing MISSING_ACTIVITY, none\n141|  on this task/story; cliresult seven-name `[0..7]` vocabulary untouched\n142|  (runtime work belongs to STORY-260916-1ea7od); localstore on explicit\n143|  `CurrentV050`, untouched.\n144|- Hygiene: gofmt clean, `git diff --check` clean, 9 JSON files valid, no\n145|  `__pycache__`/`.pyc`/stray plants, `git status` shows only the 15 modified\n146|  + 3 new candidate paths.\n147|- Suite on the exact tree (all observed this session): `go build ./...` 0,\n148|  `go vet ./...` 0, 8 touched packages green, full `go test ./... -count=1`\n149|  green, `-race` green on catalog/cataloggen-cmd/cataloggen/cigate/specpin/\n150|  specdoc/traceability, tracecheck 17/497 exit 0, adopted `-check` exit 0,\n151|  CR rev2 validation log `required=26 green=26 failed=0` on the identical\n152|  tree (every exit 0).\n153|\n154|## AC coverage: 16 of 16 rows re-driven by reviewer instruments\n155|\n156|| # | Row | Reviewer probe → production call site |\n157|| - | --- | ------------------------------------- |\n158|| 1 | 63 carried + launch-plan 1.0.0 | lock/gen cell diff → `catalog.Current()` |\n159|| 2 | gen.go regenerated, -check green | adopted==explicit==committed `cmp` → `cataloggen.Generate`, `run()` |\n160|| 3 | command 21 is the -adopted string | config grep + both exits → `run()` |\n161|| 4 | current = V070 lock/doc/inventory/sections + ReleaseV070 | baseline green + tracecheck → `VerifyRepository`, tracecheck `run()` |\n162|| 5 | two legacy projections | V060/V050 tests → `catalog.ForRelease` + legacy loop |\n163|| 6 | 7 areas bound to real Stories, unevidenced+gaps | board query 7/7 + 8 admission refusals → `VerifyRepository`+`VerifyAssignedSections` |\n164|| 7 | new bindings refuse self-minted claims | P1 attack → `VerifyRepository` |\n165|| 8 | non-Story owner refused | P3 digest refusal + board query (stated bound: prose-level, digest-enforced) |\n166|| 9 | digest re-pinned | independent recompute → `VerifyRepository` |\n167|| 10 | historical registries byte-identical | 6/6 `git diff --exit-code` vs trunk (method, not unit test) |\n168|| 11 | cigate v0.7.0/v0.4.3 roots | roots probe + drift + v0.7.1 → `cigate.VerifyContractPreservation` |\n169|| 12 | localstore on CurrentV050 | grep + full suite (unchanged package) |\n170|| 13 | pin.go P3 comment fixed | code-read verification (prose, stated bound) |\n171|| 14 | README/LOGBOOK truthful, no runtime claim | text read + admission refusals → `VerifyAssignedSections` arms |\n172|| 15 | tracecheck 17/497 + histories | tracecheck run + denominator proof → tracecheck `run()` |\n173|| 16 | historical tests unchanged + green | full suite incl. trunk adopted tests |\n174|\n175|Findings for the logbook (recorded here; LOGBOOK.md intentionally not\n176|touched — it is candidate content): (a) census-only design validated\n177|against the init-panic path with an exact-message repro; (b) legacy-loop\n178|skip is behaviorally unobservable behind freshness+exact pins\n179|(defense-in-depth note, not a defect); (c) owner Story-vs-Task enforcement\n180|is digest-level prose, with board query as the real check; (d) R2 harness\n181|regex lesson (`/13.1` matches `/13.10` — anchor subtest patterns).\n182|\n183|No Stop-The-Line condition. No changes requested.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
