ple Registry | <code>urn:ax:schema:supported-environment-tuples</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n| Environment Observation | <code>urn:ax:schema:environment-observation</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n| Native Session Observation | <code>urn:ax:schema:native-session-observation</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 7133,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1784,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
