{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d5f5","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b074-2d9a-7d23-a683-c8d705b137ba"},"sequence":2389,"recorded_at":1780531400004773,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a105643e-74d8-47fc-98b0-dd8b6640f48f","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a105643e-74d8-47fc-98b0-dd8b6640f48f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a105643e-74d8-47fc-98b0-dd8b6640f48f"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b082-ca23-70f3-8545-81e3d7b676e9"},"task_id":"01a0b082-ca23-70f3-8545-81e3d7b676e9","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b082-ca23-70f3-8545-81e3d7b676e9","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-81-1\",\n  \"command\": \"cd /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260917-110onn/worktree && head -n 20 internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go | grep -n package; sed -n '3230,3260p' README.md; echo \\\"=== assigned-section-binding tests ===\\\"; python3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\nfor f in ['internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json','internal/traceability/ownership.v0.7.0.json']:\\n    d=json.load(open(f))\\n    for c in d['acceptance_cases']:\\n        if c['id']=='assigned-section-binding':\\n            print(f, json.dumps(c['tests'], indent=0))\\\"\",\n  \"description\": \"Check test package, subsection end, case rename\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"1:package main\\nand fifty-two are `unevidenced`. Seven sections are recorded unowned.\\nAll 13 sections added by v0.6.0 name pending task owners in the reviewed\\nregistry gaps; these assignments grant no runtime admission. The\\n[adoption ownership map](internal/traceability/adoption-v0.6.0.md) separates\\nshared runtime APIs, their callers, product conformance and upstream source\\npublication validators, and preserves historical acceptance obligations.\\nThe v0.7.0 revision adds no numbered section; its launch-plan, stdin,\\ncaller_launch_plan, environment_drift and curator-run clause areas name\\npending story owners in the reviewed registry gaps, and these assignments\\ngrant no runtime admission either. The\\n[adoption ownership map](internal/traceability/adoption-v0.7.0.md) attributes\\neach clause area to its implementing story and records the shared-section\\nsplits.\\nAssigned-scope admission therefore succeeds today for `-section 6.2` and\\n`-section 2.4` and nothing else; every other assignment is refused with its\\nratio and its gap.\\nA `partial` binding is refused by assigned-scope admission exactly like an\\n`unevidenced` one: admission requires `full`.\\n\\nTwo admitted bindings out of sixty-eight cover five clauses, and that is\\ndisclosed here rather than hidden: without Section 6.2 the admit path would only\\never be exercised synthetically. Its discharge is no longer positive-only: the\\nnative-Windows lanes carry the positive arm and\\n`TestDecodeRefusesNonConptyBackendOnNativeWindows` the legacy refusal arm,\\nboth registered against the `config-versioned-readers` acceptance case.\\nSection 2.4 is the first multi-clause admission: its four clauses are\\ndischarged by the `sessprofile-derive`, `sessprofile-derive-heads`,\\n`sessprofile-fork-pair`, and `provhost-mapping-resolution` acceptance cases.\\n\\nThat is a disclosure of the shipped state, not a target that was met.\\n`TestRunRefusesEveryAssignedSectionThatOnlySlivers` and\\n=== assigned-section-binding tests ===\\ninternal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json [\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestVerifyAssignedSectionsBindsGranularScopeToOwnersAndExecutableCases\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsOneNarrowedAssignedSectionBinding\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsDetachedScopeSpecificAcceptanceCase\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsMissingScopeSpecificProductionDeclaration\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsSyntacticallyValidNonexistentV060Section\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsRenamedScalarSectionOwnerDeclarations\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestRunAdmitsOnlyAssignedSectionsWhoseBindingDischargesTheWholeSection\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestRunRefusesEveryAssignedSectionThatOnlySlivers\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestVerifyAssignedSectionsRefusesEveryBindingThatOnlySlivers\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestPlantedSliverIsReportedAndAnAdequateBindingIsStillAdmitted\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestPlantedSliverRedensTheProductionEntryPoints\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestSectionClauseInventoryIsMeasuredFromThePinnedDocument\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestCoverageBucketNamesTheMeasuredRatio\\\"\\n}\\n]\\ninternal/traceability/ownership.v0.7.0.json [\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestVerifyAssignedSectionsBindsGranularScopeToOwnersAndExecutableCases\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsOneNarrowedAssignedSectionBinding\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsDetachedScopeSpecificAcceptanceCase\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsMissingScopeSpecificProductionDeclaration\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsSyntacticallyValidNonexistentV070Section\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestMainRejectsRenamedScalarSectionOwnerDeclarations\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestRunAdmitsOnlyAssignedSectionsWhoseBindingDischargesTheWholeSection\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestRunRefusesEveryAssignedSectionThatOnlySlivers\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestVerifyAssignedSectionsRefusesEveryBindingThatOnlySlivers\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestPlantedSliverIsReportedAndAnAdequateBindingIsStillAdmitted\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestPlantedSliverRedensTheProductionEntryPoints\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestSectionClauseInventoryIsMeasuredFromThePinnedDocument\\\"\\n},\\n{\\n\\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/traceability/traceability_test.go\\\",\\n\\\"declaration\\\": \\\"TestCoverageBucketNamesTheMeasuredRatio\\\"\\n}\\n]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5587,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1397,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
